      "s": 6.61,
      "e": 10.04,
      "text": "aeronautics, and technology that support future exploration."
    },
    {
      "s": 10.04,
      "e": 13.25,
      "text": "Hereâs a look at whatâs happened this week, in your NASA Minute."
    },
    {
      "s": 15.18,
      "e": 17.45,
      "text": "On Thursday, NASA  observed our annual"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.45,
      "e": 19.92,
